### A1 Standorthierarchie verwalten
# Voraussetzung: ./mvnw spring-boot:run (Umgebung "dev" = Dev-Seed, "testdata" = nach scripts/generate-data.sql)

### Alle Standorte (lesen ohne Header)
GET {{host}}/api/locations

### Standort anlegen (Wurzel) → 201
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": null, "name": "Zürich", "type": "BRANCH" }

> {% client.global.set("branchId", response.body.id); %}

### Gebäude darunter → 201
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": {{branchId}}, "name": "Gebäude Nord", "type": "BUILDING" }

> {% client.global.set("buildingId", response.body.id); %}

### Etage darunter → 201
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": {{buildingId}}, "name": "EG", "type": "FLOOR" }

> {% client.global.set("floorId", response.body.id); %}

### Ändern (umbenennen) → 200
PUT {{host}}/api/locations/{{buildingId}}
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": {{branchId}}, "name": "Gebäude Süd", "type": "BUILDING" }

### Zyklus: Standort unter die eigene Etage hängen → 400 (DB-Trigger)
PUT {{host}}/api/locations/{{branchId}}
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": {{floorId}}, "name": "Zürich", "type": "BRANCH" }

### Ungültige Eingabe (leerer Name) → 400
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": null, "name": "", "type": "BRANCH" }

### Ohne Header → 401
POST {{host}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": null, "name": "Basel", "type": "BRANCH" }

### Kein Admin → 403
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": null, "name": "Basel", "type": "BRANCH" }

### Unbekannter Standort → 404
GET {{host}}/api/locations/999999

### Deaktivieren (Soft Delete) → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/locations/{{floorId}}
X-User-Id: {{admin}}

### Deaktivierter Standort bleibt lesbar (active = false)
GET {{host}}/api/locations/{{floorId}}
